      "finalPromptText": "Genuine specification change. Replay ALL events from empty state under the amended rules.\n\nAmendment A1: deduplication now uses the pair (eventID, revision) instead of the eventID alone.\nAmendment A2: an event applies when its revision is greater than OR EQUAL TO the job's current revision.\n\nAll other rules R2 through R6 are unchanged, and processing is still in written order.\n\nAppend these events after the original nine, in this order: (e9,A,5,ready); (e10,C,2,revert); (e11,B,4,ready); (e12,C,2,blocked).\n\nReturn ONLY the same raw JSON shape, covering the entire replay. No prose, no fences.",
